Source code in <code>warriorfit/data/model/db_model.py</code> <pre><code>def age_from_birthdate(self) -&gt; int:
    if isinstance(self.birthdate, str):
        d = datetime.strptime(self.birthdate, "%Y-%m-%d").date()
    elif isinstance(self.birthdate, datetime):
        d = self.birthdate.date()
    else:
        d = self.birthdate
    today = date.today()
    return today.year - d.year - ((today.month, today.day) &lt; (d.month, d.day))
</code></pre>

Source code in <code>warriorfit/data/model/db_model.py</code> <pre><code>def age_from_birthdate_and_session_date(self, date_session: date | TIMESTAMP) -&gt; int:
    if isinstance(self.birthdate, str):
        b = datetime.strptime(self.birthdate, "%Y-%m-%d").date()
    elif isinstance(self.birthdate, datetime):
        b = self.birthdate.date()
    else:
        b = self.birthdate
    return (
        date_session.year - b.year - ((date_session.month, date_session.day) &lt; (b.month, b.day))  # type: ignore[union-attr]
    )
